# Validation Gates

No implementation is considered complete until every required validation gate passes.

## Validation Gates

Gate 1 — Dataset Integrity (`scripts/validate_dataset.py`)

Gate 2 — Feature Integrity (`scripts/validate_features.py`)

Gate 3 — Split Integrity (`scripts/validate_splits.py`)

Gate 4 — Model Integrity (unit tests + smoke path)

Gate 5 — Training Integrity (`scripts/smoke_test.py` + pre-training audit)

Gate 6 — Evaluation Integrity (`scripts/check_artifacts.py`, metrics contracts)

Gate 7 — Reproducibility (`scripts/reproducibility_check.py`)

Gate 8 — Artifact Integrity (`scripts/check_artifacts.py`)

If any gate fails:

STOP.

Explain the failure.

Fix the implementation.

Run validation again.

Only continue after PASS.

Use `python scripts/workflow.py pre-training` or `python scripts/workflow.py ci-local` to execute ordered gates.
